menu items ["Single player","Multiplayer","Test range","Settings","Extras","Credits","Random battlefield","Next: Nation →","IRIranAsymmetric Warfare · morale: ZealousDoctrine: Asymmetric Warfare (infantry, AT teams and drones holding still or in cover deal 20% more damage; infantry and light vehicles sprint 25% faster for 3s after firing). Morale style: Zealous - Slow to break; fervor rises as comrades fall and banners rally the faithful. They hold their ground, so they take heavier losses. Missiles & cheap drones: Shahed drones cost 25% less and build almost twice as fast, Fateh missile launchers fire 12% farther and hit 15% harder, the Kheibar barrage charges faster. Tunnel warfare: hidden tunnels move units across the map instantly.Special: IRGC Field Commander · thermoStrike: Kheibar Missile Strike","Lebanese ShiaFortress & Ambush · morale: ZealousDoctrine: Fortress & Ambush (infantry, AT teams and drones holding still or in cover deal 20% more damage; +15% damage near their own buildings). Morale style: Zealous - Slow to break; fervor rises as comrades fall and banners rally the faithful. They hold their ground, so they take heavier losses. The Lebanese mountain Shia resistance: stone villages of Bint Jbeil and the Bekaa, Ashura banners and Ya Hussein walls, rocket barrages, cheap strong drones, ATGM ambush teams, tunnels and mountain forts. Longer-ranged rockets that fire faster, far stronger Defense Guns and tunnels, infantry whose dugouts take 30% less damage. No air force or navy. Tunnel warfare: hidden tunnels move units across the map instantly.Special: Mountain Rocket Team · bunkersStrike: Mountain Rocket Storm","Zaidi Shia MovementDesert Raiders · morale: ZealousDoctrine: Desert Raiders (infantry, AT teams and drones holding still or in cover deal 20% more damage; infantry and light vehicles sprint 25% faster for 3s after firing). Morale style: Zealous - Slow to break; fervor rises as comrades fall and banners rally the faithful. They hold their ground,